    "html": "<p>The escape speed from planet A is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v_{A}\"></span>. Planet B has three times the density and twice the radius of planet A. The escape speed from planet B is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v_{B}\"></span>. What is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{v_{A}}{v_{B}}\"></span>?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{6}}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{12}}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{24}}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
